# Testing Standards

These standards apply to ALL code in this project.

## Requirements

- Minimum coverage: [80%]
- All new code must have tests
- Test naming: `describe('[Unit]', () => { it('should [expected behavior]') })`

## Test Organization

```
tests/
+-- unit/          # Unit tests (isolated)
+-- integration/   # Integration tests (with dependencies)
+-- e2e/           # End-to-end tests
```

## Running Tests

```bash
# All tests
npm test

# With coverage
npm test -- --coverage

# Specific file
npm test -- --grep "user"
```
